# Kebu Pricing

Full spec: `docs/product/KEBU-PRICING.md` · Code: `lib/billing/plans.ts`.

## Mission

Do **not** price like Shopify/Wix (~$29+/mo e-commerce). African youth affordability is core — **not** $20–30/mo as the default ask.

## Canonical tiers (Builder + Store)

| Plan | $/mo | Role |
|------|------|------|
| Free | 0 | Build before you pay |
| Starter | 2 | Creators, personal sites |
| **Shop** | **5** | **Hero** — small businesses selling |
| Business | 10 | Growing businesses |
| Pro | 20 | Serious teams (cap — not $30) |
| Student | 1 | Verified students (verification slice) |

## Rules

- **$5 Shop** = push hardest; must deliver real website + store + hosting + analytics + AI — with **honest limits**.
- **Capability grows with tier** — not punishment for merchant success.
- **Multi-revenue:** subscription + transparent transaction fee + domains + email + AI overage + templates + Reach — not subscription-only squeeze.
- **Personal Kebu** stays FREE (account model) — these tiers are business/site infrastructure.
- **Forbidden:** unlimited claims at $5 · fake Shop bundle items on pricing · student $5 when $1/free verification is the target.
- Enforce limits **server-side** when implementing gates — UI hiding ≠ authorization.

Marketing headline: **“Everything you need to build your business.”** — not “cheaper than Shopify” alone.
